Seen Nate Marshall on "Gilly and Keeves"? Houston, you're in for a treat. Nate brings an honest, insightful style that digs deep into race, relationships, and even dog-walking. Originally from Philly, he’s made a mark in New York and now he's coming to The Gordy. His stories feel like a chat with a friend. You won't want to miss this. The Gordy · Saturday, April 4, 2026. Link in bio for tickets. Tag someone you'd bring. 

